==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns after 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage might look terrifying at first, but it can easily be done with a critical hitter(ie.[[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] or [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat) |Cat Researcher]]), a anti-metal/black crowd controller (e.g. [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoopmaster Cat]], [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bomber Cat]],) and anti-Dark attackers.(e.g. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza/Ring Girl Cat]]).You can also bring anti-Dark/metal meat shields such as [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono CC]] or [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Modern/Future Cat]] to aid success. You can start by luring the [[Metal Doge]] to your base and stack a few crowd controllers on it and quickly kill it with your critical hitter. Once you hit the base, deploy all of your meat shields, crowd controllers and attackers. If you manage to permanently freeze the [[Bun Bun Black]], you have a very good chance of easily finishing the rest of this stage, as the [[Metal One Horn]] will keep your crowd control units form dying at the hands of [[Director Kurosawah]] if they are properly protected.

